{"version":1,"content":"<p>使用AI代理的用户馬特·史密斯注意到，AI並沒有像往常一樣完成購物訂單，而是為他訂購了數量奇怪的雞蛋。馬特·史密斯並沒有在購物清單上列出雞蛋;然而，AI助手卻在他的購物車裏添加了四包當地知名品牌「Vital Farms」的大號雞蛋。每包雞蛋有18枚，總共72枚雞蛋送到了他家。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/funny/1586810.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:37:33.462222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:12:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.304258+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.304258+00:00","content_hash":"e328ea8185ed007f0e5edebb5ef8193f510d09fd61a469fe4fc1a912c5abab67","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}